WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.004
DAVID HARBOUR
Hey everybody, in Black Widow,

00:00:02.004 --> 00:00:06.611
I play Red Guardian.
A superhero spy who is also a dad.

00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:08.357
So you ready
for some zingers?

00:00:08.357 --> 00:00:10.357
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
Hmm, if we must, yeah.

00:00:10.381 --> 00:00:11.849
DAVID HARBOUR
Hey, hey guys...

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:15.595
Why did the
Black Widow wear a disguise?

00:00:15.595 --> 00:00:18.516
DAVID HARBOUR
Because she was a SPY-der.

00:00:19.278 --> 00:00:20.643
FLORENCE PUGH
[Laughing] Oh my god...

00:00:20.643 --> 00:00:22.055
DAVID HARBOUR
I don't even have to read 'em from

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.468
the book, I know 'em.

00:00:23.468 --> 00:00:26.762
What are a spy's
favorite type of shoes?

00:00:27.397 --> 00:00:30.500
Sneakers.
[Laughing]

00:00:31.603 --> 00:00:32.333
DAVID HARBOUR
Hey, guys?

00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:33.333
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
You like that one?

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.428
DAVID HARBOUR
Guys, what do you call a Canadian spy?

00:00:37.008 --> 00:00:38.792
A double EH-gent.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.372
I myself don't
even like that one

00:00:42.397 --> 00:00:48.230
Last week I discovered an Australian
gorilla spying on me, and,

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.357
y'know what I told him?
Y'know what I said?

00:00:50.381 --> 00:00:54.024
I said "hey, don't PRY... Mate."

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:59.452
Don't, "pry, mate" but
it's also like the word "primate."

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:07.944
Hey, guys? Clint Barton's brother has
a super smelling ability? They call him...

00:01:07.944 --> 00:01:10.015
Hawknose.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.119
'Cause his real
name is Hawkeye.

00:01:13.119 --> 00:01:14.786
Just admit it, you love my jokes.

00:01:14.786 --> 00:01:16.333
FLORENCE PUGH
I actually liked a few.

00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:18.436
DAVID HARBOUR
Yeah, see? I'll take it.

